  "title": "Osso Bucco-Style Beef Shank",
  "description": "Osso bucco is traditionally made with veal, but in this recipe a beef shank is simmered in tomato sauce with herbs and lemon zest until super tender.",
  "authors": [
    "Julie Couture"
  ],
